; --- THE CAT: the weakest attack and the most help. It stays underfoot, swipes at what comes right up to
; the wizard and bats bolts away from him, and while it is out every spell he casts runs faster and he
; slips more hits: 8% cast speed and 4% evasion at level 1 (Familiar.CatCastSpeed, CatEvasion), and its
; levels add to them (Effect 21 is Cast speed, 22 Evasion - SpellEffect; Player folds them in, live,
; through Familiar.GrantsOf). Its swipe gets a point a level. One cat, always. Level 8: 14 a swipe every
; 0.8 s, and 17% cast speed and 10% evasion for the wizard.

